# The build context here is only build/ — the Magento tree arrives as a
# BuildKit named context (see the Dockerfile's builder stage), so there is
# nothing large to exclude. These entries keep editor and OS droppings out of
# the image layers anyway, because a changed .swp file would otherwise bust
# the cache on every rebuild.
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/*.swp
**/.DS_Store
